@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+name: enhance-prompt
+repo: https://github.com/tuancookiez-hub/hermes-enhance-prompt
+sha: 8417827ff80db2335e18742c1f5317aeb4b036cb
+version: "0.7.0"
+requires_hermes: ">=0.21.5"
+title: Enhance Prompt
+description: "A sparkle beside Send that rewrites the composer draft in place without sending it, deepening it into a clarifier, a task list, then a phased plan on further clicks, with a one-click discard back to the original. Also registers the `/enhance` slash command and the `enhance_prompt` tool for the same rewrite from the agent. Draft read and write go through `host.composer`, so `@file` and `/command` chips survive. Disclosure — every click runs one stateless `llm.oneshot` call on your own gateway with the focused chat's model (the auxiliary title model when no chat is focused), followed by a second short call to score the result, so it spends your model credits. It is not an agent turn: no tools run and nothing is written to a session you cannot see. It overrides no model, sends nothing to a third party, never sends the composer message, and carries no telemetry, no credentials and no self-update."
+maintainer: tuancookiez-hub
+tier: community
+category: desktop
+docs_url: https://github.com/tuancookiez-hub/hermes-enhance-prompt/blob/8417827ff80db2335e18742c1f5317aeb4b036cb/README.md
+readme: true
+image: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tuancookiez-hub/hermes-enhance-prompt/8417827ff80db2335e18742c1f5317aeb4b036cb/assets/hero-banner.png
+screenshots:
+  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tuancookiez-hub/hermes-enhance-prompt/8417827ff80db2335e18742c1f5317aeb4b036cb/assets/overview.png
+platforms:
+  - linux
+  - macos
+  - windows
+capabilities:
+  provides_tools:
+    - enhance_prompt
+  provides_hooks: []
+  provides_middleware: []
+  requires_env: []
+known_issues:
+  - "The Desktop half needs a Hermes build with the composer draft API (`host.composer`); on an older Desktop the sparkle reports that an update is needed."
+  - "One model call per click, and the score is an extra call. Cancel stops the client-side wait only — the in-flight call may still finish."
+  - "Uses the chat's model; there is no separate model setting. Switch the chat model first to enhance with another one."
+  - "Not a fork of `prompt-enhancer`: this one is a separate plugin with an agent tool, a slash command, three deepening stages and a scorer."
