try; imports private Hermes kanban, i18n, profile, plugin and Telegram-network modules (listed in its README); ships an optional core patch adding kanban veto hooks that the user applies by hand to the Hermes checkout (the plugin never applies it, and `hermes update` drops it), and registers kanban_pre_claim only on a Hermes build that exposes it."
